saved before reloading.":["F\u00f6r denna \u00e4ndring kr\u00e4vs det att sidan laddas om. Se till att du har sparat inneh\u00e5llet innan du laddar om sidan."],"All content copied.":["Allt inneh\u00e5ll kopierat."],"Editor footer":["Sidfot i redigeraren"],"Keyboard shortcuts":["Tangentbordsgenv\u00e4gar"],"Welcome Guide":["V\u00e4lkomstguide"],"Page attributes":["Sidattribut"],"View post":["Visa inl\u00e4gg"],"inserter":["infogaren"],"Welcome to the block editor":["V\u00e4lkommen till blockredigeraren"],"Get started":["Kom ig\u00e5ng"],"In the WordPress editor, each paragraph, image, or video is presented as a distinct \u201cblock\u201d of content.":["I WordPress redigerare visas varje textstycke, bild eller videoklipp som ett separat \u201dinneh\u00e5llsblock\u201d."],"Make each block your own":["G\u00f6r varje block till ditt eget"],"Each block comes with its own set of controls for changing things like color, width, and alignment. These will show and hide automatically when you have a block selected.":["Varje block inneh\u00e5ller sin egen upps\u00e4ttning reglage f\u00f6r att \u00e4ndra s\u00e5dant som f\u00e4rg, bredd och justering. Dessa visas och d\u00f6ljs automatiskt n\u00e4r du v\u00e4ljer ett block."],"Get to know the block library":["L\u00e4r k\u00e4nna blockbiblioteket"],"All of the blocks available to you live in the block library. You\u2019ll find it wherever you see the <InserterIconImage \/> icon.":["Alla blocken \u00e4r tillg\u00e4ngliga direkt i blockbiblioteket. Du hittar det \u00f6verallt d\u00e4r du ser ikonen <InserterIconImage \/>."],"Learn how to use the block editor":["L\u00e4r dig hur du anv\u00e4nder blockredigeraren"],"New to the block editor? Want to learn more about using it? ":["Har du just b\u00f6rjat med blockredigeraren? Vill du veta mer om hur du anv\u00e4nder den?"],"Here's a detailed guide.":["H\u00e4r \u00e4r en detaljerad handledning."],"Open block settings":["\u00d6ppna blockets inst\u00e4llningar"],"Open document settings":["\u00d6ppna dokumentets inst\u00e4llningar"],"Contain text cursor inside block":["H\u00e5ll kvar textmarkeringen inom blocket"],"Preview in new tab":["F\u00f6rhandsgranska i ny flik"],"Open save panel":["\u00d6ppna sparade panelen"],"Open the block list view.":["\u00d6ppna vyn med blocklista."],"Preferences":["Alternativ"],"Include pre-publish checklist":["Inkludera checklistan f\u00f6re publicering"],"Places the most frequent blocks in the block library.":["L\u00e4gger de oftast anv\u00e4nda blocken i blockbiblioteket."],"Show most used blocks":["Visa de mest anv\u00e4nda blocken"],"Aids screen readers by stopping text caret from leaving blocks.":["Hj\u00e4lper sk\u00e4rml\u00e4sare genom att hindra textmark\u00f6ren fr\u00e5n att l\u00e4mna block."],"Appearance":["Utseende"],"Highlights the current block and fades other content.":["Markerar det nuvarande blocket och tonar ner annat inneh\u00e5ll."],"Make the editor look like your theme.":["L\u00e5t redigeraren se ut som ditt tema."],"Use theme styles":["Anv\u00e4nd temats stilar"],"Choose what displays in the panel.":["V\u00e4lj vad som visas i panelen."],"Add extra areas to the editor.":["L\u00e4gg till extra omr\u00e5den till redigeraren."],"%s (selected)":["%s (markerat)"],"Shows block breadcrumbs at the bottom of the editor.":["Visar synliga s\u00f6kv\u00e4gar f\u00f6r block nederst i redigeraren."],"Display block breadcrumbs":["Visa synliga s\u00f6kv\u00e4gar f\u00f6r block"],"Panels":["Paneler"],"Additional":["Ytterligare"],"Editing template: ":["Redigerar mall: "],"Editing template. Changes made here affect all posts and pages that use the template.":["Redigerar mall. \u00c4ndringar som g\u00f6rs h\u00e4r kommer att p\u00e5verka alla inl\u00e4gg och sidor d\u00e4r mallen anv\u00e4nds."],"Block Library":["Blockbiblioteket"],"Custom template created. You're in template mode now.":["Anpassad mall skapad. Du \u00e4r i mall-l\u00e4get nu."],"Generic label for block inserter button\u0004Toggle block inserter":["